&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Advise clients regarding innovative technology and content to help them make better decisions. Recommend relevant strategies and work with customers to prepare implementation and migration strategies.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Advise, author, and guide airport planning and design activities on master plans, airport layout plans, and/or airspace integration initiatives for internal and external clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Understand our clients and know their business.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with the National Aviation Services Operations team and dedicated aviation staff to deliver the practice goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Assist in business growth of Aviation Planning, AAM applications, and other consulting services by developing and supporting a pipeline of new and existing business/contract opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
