&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain industry expertise in emerging technologies and regulations, including partnerships with strategic industry leaders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Maintain a thought-leader/Subject Matter Expert profile in the industry by preparing related articles and/or speaking at regional conference presentations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
