&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Woolpert is seeking a Bridge Design Engineer to join our growing Transportation team in one of our Ohio locations. As a bridge engineer, you will be involved in diverse transportation projects spanning multiple locations, clients, complexity, and size. In addition to steel and concrete bridges, you will be exposed to work involving retaining walls, culverts, and other unique specialties including pedestrian timber suspension bridges and covered bridge rehabilitations. Given the wide range of markets within Woolpert, our engineers often collaborate with disciplines outside of the transportation group, providing structural design support for our Energy, Aviation, and Water Resources practices.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. &amp;nbsp;Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Work as part of a diverse team of Licensed Professionals, EITs, and interns to complete bridge and other transportation tasks.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead and perform design for various aspects of bridge, retaining wall, and culvert design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Prepare project analyses, load ratings, structure type studies, construction plans, and reports related to infrastructure projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Demonstrate knowledge and application of engineering principles and ability to complete design and analysis calculations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Review or check design calculations, engineering estimates, and plans developed by others.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Perform hydraulic studies in relation to bridge design development.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Provide mentorship and support to other engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Must have ABET Accredited Bachelor’s Degree in Civil Engineering.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Minimum of 5 years professional experience with understanding of bridge design and engineering principles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ohio PE License (or can be obtained within 6 months of employment).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience in steel and concrete design.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Experience with bridge analysis software (OpenBridge Designer, finite element modeling, line girder analysis).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong written and oral communication skills and report writing ability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ability to work in AutoCAD Civil3D or Bentley MicroStation/OpenRoads Designer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Strong knowledge of Ohio DOT and AASHTO design standards.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
