&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;This position can support&amp;nbsp;in-office&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;hybrid working arrangements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
