&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Create and sustain a pipeline of opportunities with TxDOT and/or local governments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Build and enhance existing client relationships to identify and initiate additional project opportunities within a client base for the service line, practice area, and firm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Shape Strategic pursuits and teaming.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Promotes Woolpert as an industry leader for specified market/practice and service(s) with new and existing clients.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
