&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Direct management of TxDOT and local projects.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Mentorship of project task leads and/or deputy project managers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Assists project managers in (or perform) negotiation of project schedule, fee, scope and contract terms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Mentors Project Managers’ sales aptitude, through in person mentoring, introduction to clients, and interview coaching.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
