&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;The ability to think beyond the next pursuit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;A desire to build, lead, and leave a mark.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Must be able to travel to meet the needs and demands of the practice area.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Must demonstrate an enterprising, innovative, proactive management approach.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Must possess high levels of demonstrated leadership ability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
