&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Don’t have&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;all&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;of these? That’s ok, we know you’re coming to learn. Apply if you think this can be a good fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be enrolled as a student at an accredited college or university, preferably with at least sophomore status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pursuing a Civil Engineering or construction management degree (or related field)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a general interest in construction management / inspection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have a good attitude&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be self-motivated and self-reliant&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have exceptional multitasking and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have reliable transportation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to analyze and program independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Applies professional judgment and discretion&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy being in the field rather than behind a desk&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assignments may include travel and extended overnight stays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$27 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
