&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Strong understanding of civil engineering and land development construction practices, including means and methods&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Experience with construction inspection, observation reporting, and quantity tracking&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Proficiency in Microsoft Office (Word, Excel)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Familiarity with AutoCAD Civil 3D is a plus&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to effectively interact with clients and internal teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Ability to provide constructive feedback and guidance to team members&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;OSHA 10-Hour Construction Certification (or ability to obtain)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Ability to safely navigate construction sites and comply with all safety requirements&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Travel Requirements &amp;amp; Compensation:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: bold; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Travel is highly seasonal, with approximately 100% travel from April through October and approximately 25-50% travel from November through March to support onsite airport projects across the Western United States.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
