&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Opportunities to take on new challenges, lead projects, and expand skill sets, further enhancing personal and professional capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
