&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to work independently as well as in a collaborative team environment; offer constructive feedback and direction to support goals.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Interest in unique challenges requiring creative solutions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
