&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Woolpert, Inc. is a cutting-edge national architecture, engineering and geospatial (AEG) firm that delivers value to clients by blending engineering excellence with innovative technology and geospatial applications.&amp;nbsp; Woolpert was recently certified as an Employer of Choice by Great Place to Work®.&amp;nbsp; We believe great companies are built from exceptional people and amazing clients. We are seeking a Transportation Roads Condition Assessment Technician Intern in &lt;strong&gt;Oregon &lt;/strong&gt;for the Summer Quarter (May– September).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Transportation Condition Assessment Technician Intern (Geospatial Field Intern) will be working alongside Woolpert professional engineers, condition assessment experts, transportation advisors and BLM staff collecting and processing survey data. Some projects could be assisting with GIS, completing transportation PASER analysis, performing aggregate depth analysis and data collection.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This internship is an onsite role. Woolpert does not provide housing or relocation for internships/co-ops.&lt;br&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working as part of the integrated Roads Condition Assessment Field team and transportation program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Providing support and learning to plan field assessment processes with senior staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working directly with client under supervision of senior management to validate schedules and plan for approval&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gaining real-world experience collecting data in the field with licensed professional engineers and condition assessment experts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assisting with the collection and processing of data for the Bureau of Land Management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;based on government rate. Company credit card will be supplied for all hotels and flights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be enrolled as a student at an accredited college or university, with at least sophomore status&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be studying engineering, forestry, or related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work outside in the field, no matter the weather conditions or environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;General understanding and willingness to learn various survey equipment and Trimble Business Center Software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform tasks and solve problems with a high degree of independence&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to function well in a collaborative, team-oriented environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exceptional multitasking and time management skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to travel when needed through the duration of the internship, as this project requires 2 weeks in the field and is part-time as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to pass a background check and drug screen prior to employment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to drive GMC2500 vehicle with camper&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to backdown mountain sides with limited visibility, turn vehicle around in extremely tight locations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lift 50+ lbs. and operate a jackhammer and use a pickaxe to core roads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have no fear of heights or motion sickness due to extremely curvy and mountainous ranges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No fear of wilderness areas for long periods of time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding that no cell phone use will be used during the assessment periods, as focus is required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Possess credit card or funds to pay for food for a two -week period as government per diem is paid back at the end of your extended stay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$27 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert is an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; Woolpert is committed to the full inclusion of all individuals. We recruit, train, compensate, and promote regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law.&amp;nbsp; You may view more about EEO on our website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&quot;&gt;Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/EEO-is-the-Law-Supplement.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law Poster Supplement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants who require an accommodation throughout the application and interview process should request this in advance by contacting your Recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all agencies: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please, no phone calls or emails to any employee of Woolpert or any of our subsidiaries about this requisition. All resumes submitted by search firms/employment agencies to any employee at Woolpert via email, the internet, or in any form and/or method will be deemed the sole property of Woolpert, unless such search firms/employment agencies were engaged by Woolpert&#39;s Talent Acquisition Team for this requisition and a valid agreement is in place. In the event a candidate who was submitted outside of Woolpert&#39;s applicant process is hired, no fee or payment of any kind will be paid.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Woolpert is hiring a Geospatial Specialist &amp;nbsp;to join its dynamic Geospatial team at the Johannesburg, South Africa office. Woolpert Africa, with offices in Johannesburg and Cape Town, South Africa, offers extensive expertise in high-accuracy LiDAR, imagery, and remote sensing, as well as airborne topographic, hyperspectral, and thermal survey and mapping services. The company delivers advanced mapping solutions for the engineering, infrastructure, mining, agriculture, and environmental sectors across more than 45 African countries.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe great companies are built from exceptional people and amazing clients. Due to our ongoing growth, we are seeking an experienced Geospatial LiDAR Processor in Johannesburg.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;As a Geospatial LiDAR Processor&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;strong&gt;at Woolpert, you will&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process and analyse airborne and ground data to meet client specifications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply advanced digital mapping techniques, including LiDAR post-processing, photogrammetry, and terrain modelling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform LiDAR post-processing tasks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct aerial triangulation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Carry out orthophoto rectification&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create and edit DEM (Digital Elevation Model) and DSM (Digital Surface Model) outputs Develop 3D mesh models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Process oblique imagery&lt;br&gt;Contribute to planning and problem-solving in sectors such as environmental&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;conservation, urban planning, disaster management, and resource exploration&lt;br&gt;Work successfully within a team, follow detailed instructions, and consistently demonstrate professionalism across all tasks and interactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively receive, backup, evaluate, and analyze LiDAR, imagery, and ground data, ensuring data quality and error detection.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Efficiently process airborne data to client-ready deliverables that meet specified requirements and accuracy standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform QC/QA reviews, provide clear and accurate progress updates, and collaborate with the LiDAR Team Leader and senior team members to drive continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3 Years experience in the Geospatial industry.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relevant qualifications in Geography, Geomatics, Geospatial Sciences, GIS, Remote Sensing, or a related field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in basic GIS software packages, QGIS, Global Mapper, ESRI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of geospatial data formats, coordinate systems, and data projections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent problem-solving skills and the ability to translate complex spatial concepts into actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong attention to detail and commitment to data accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effective communication skills, both written and verbal, to convey technical information to non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work independently as well as collaboratively within a team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior experience working with LiDAR, GIS, and remote sensing technologies is preferred, for example: Terrasolid &amp;amp; Microstation etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-KS1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unique Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Certified as a Great Place to Work®, Woolpert is one of the fastest growing architecture, engineering, and geospatial (AEG) companies in the world. With over 60 offices and countless projects around the globe, Woolpert makes a real difference at home and abroad. In addition to offering competitive pay, we provide employees with a robust set of unique benefits, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Diverse experiences: Work on meaningful projects that improve quality of life around the world.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Freedom to work program: Set your own schedule and location (as appropriate).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Principal program: Earn the opportunity to become an owner of the firm.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career development: Explore a wide range of learning and growth opportunities within and across industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fitness reimbursement, technology stipend, employee assistance program, and more: Choose the benefits that work best for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Level up your career with Woolpert. Apply today and join our team to help shape the future of tomorrow!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Woolpert?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Woolpert is looking for supportive, goal-oriented, and career-minded individuals who are, or are looking to become, industry leaders in their fields. We blend design excellence with innovative technology and geospatial applications to deliver exceptional value to our clients. When you join us, you&#39;ll join a team of experts who are passionate about their work and dedicated to building the next generation of industry leaders. Woolpert embraces progress and innovation, creating limitless opportunities for your career growth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert is an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; Woolpert is committed to the full inclusion of all individuals. We recruit, train, compensate, and promote regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law.&amp;nbsp; You may view more about EEO on our website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&quot;&gt;Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/EEO-is-the-Law-Supplement.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law Poster Supplement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants who require an accommodation throughout the application and interview process should request this in advance by contacting your Recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all agencies: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please, no phone calls or emails to any employee of Woolpert or any of our subsidiaries about this requisition. All resumes submitted by search firms/employment agencies to any employee at Woolpert via email, the internet, or in any form and/or method will be deemed the sole property of Woolpert, unless such search firms/employment agencies were engaged by Woolpert&#39;s Talent Acquisition Team for this requisition and a valid agreement is in place. In the event a candidate who was submitted outside of Woolpert&#39;s applicant process is hired, no fee or payment of any kind will be paid.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Woolpert is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Geotechnical Technician&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Infrastructure Team&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;at our &lt;strong&gt;Harrisburg, PA&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;office. This position reports to the &lt;strong&gt;Geotechnical Team Leader&lt;/strong&gt; and is responsible performing intermediate-level geotechnical field and laboratory testing in support of public and private infrastructure projects. Works under the general supervision of senior technicians, engineers, and project managers. Responsibilities include conducting standardized field and lab tests, documenting results, supporting drilling operations, and ensuring compliance with quality and safety procedures for the Aviation, Water, and Transportation Markets. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. &amp;nbsp;Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;Collect and document soil, concrete, asphalt, and aggregate samples in accordance with project requirements &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Support geotechnical drilling operations: log samples, assist drill crews, and prepare boring logs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Maintain accurate and complete field notes, test results, chain of custody documentation, and daily activity reports &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Perform geotechnical field testing including nuclear density gauges, soil classification, compaction testing, moisture content testing, and concrete/asphalt sampling &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assist with typed boring logs and geotechnical report preparation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Apply established techniques, procedures, and testing criteria consistently &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Calibrate, maintain, and operate field/lab equipment with minimal guidance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Observe site construction activities for compliance with plans, specifications, and material requirements&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Communicate test results and deficiencies to contractors and senior personnel &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Assist in reviewing and interpreting project plans, site drawings, and specifications&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Support contract documentation, reporting, and project recordkeeping &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Identify and communicate work items deemed unacceptable&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Assist with training and mentoring entry-level technicians&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Follow Woolpert safety standards and ensure safety protocols are executed on job sites &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Contribute to tracking project progress, resolving issues, and supporting quality assurance and quality control processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;High school diploma or equivalent required.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;3+ years of combined experience in geotechnical drilling inspection or related fieldwork required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Valid driver&#39;s license required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;10-Hour OSHA Construction Certificate or ability to obtain required. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;PennDOT Drill Inspection Certification or ability to obtain required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated knowledge of geotechnical field and laboratory testing standards (ASTM, AASHTO) &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to complete accurate and detailed field and laboratory documentation&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Strong written and verbal communication skills &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to safely work on active construction sites &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Ability to read and understand site plans, specifications, and technical documents&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt; Strong attention to detail and ability to work independently in the field&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;PREFERRED EDUCATION and EXPERIENCE:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Associates or higher-level degree in a related field preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Completed internship and coursework in geotechnical engineering with hands-on field and lab experience preferred. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Field &amp;amp; lab expertise: Conducting soil and rock sampling, in-situ tests (SPT, CPT), advanced lab testing, and site investigations. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Data management &amp;amp; reporting: Organizing, analyzing, and reporting geotechnical data using software like gINT, Excel, or AutoCAD. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Technical knowledge &amp;amp; safety: Understanding soil mechanics, construction practices, and site safety; ability to work independently and support engineering decisions. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
