&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Woolpert is looking for a Hydrographic Survey Specialist to join our Hydrographic Survey team out of our Port Orchard, WA office. This is a great opportunity for someone who wants to spend real time in the field, working on marine infrastructure, marine construction, and navigational charting surveys throughout Oregon and California. Travel to other states will come up as project needs dictate, and candidates should expect approximately 100 days of travel throughout each year.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are especially interested in candidates who bring both survey skills and vessel operation experience, including towing vessels on trailers.&amp;nbsp;Ideally&amp;nbsp;this person can run the boat as well as run the survey.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
