&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;None of the above is required on day one. We regularly hire people with a variety of backgrounds and give them adequate training on all of these topics, but candidates who already have exposure to any of it is preferred.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
