&lt;li data-start=&quot;1453&quot; data-end=&quot;1555&quot;&gt;Currently enrolled in or recently graduated from a degree program relevant to your field of interest&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;1558&quot; data-end=&quot;1637&quot;&gt;Enthusiastic about learning, solving problems, and contributing to team goals&lt;/li&gt;
