&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a GEOMAP Data Engineer&amp;nbsp; at Woolpert, you will:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop custom applications, web services and enterprise solutions using Python&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Develop tools and scripts to automate complex data processing tasks and routine geoprocessing operations for the Air Force geospatial enterprise system&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Design user-friendly interfaces and ensure application performance and quality&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Integrate data across applications and conduct code, automation, and dashboard reviews with teammates&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create and manage GEOMAP dashboards and Portal content with enterprise teams&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Create, maintain, and improve enterprise geoprocessing services&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Troubleshoot and optimize existing applications for improved efficiency&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Administer integrations with other systems and manage on-premises data gateways&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Support and troubleshoot GIS software, script, and tool performance&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Upgrade and migrate existing GIS applications and services to the Cloud One (Amazon Web Services) environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Utilize the GeoBase Agile framework to enable task visibility and project transparency to AFCEC client:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Use Agile platform (Jira, Confluence) to record all processes and tasks, and manage all projects&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
