&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot; data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. &amp;nbsp;Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located. &amp;nbsp; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;I-SN1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
