&lt;li style=&quot;color: #333333; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &#39;Verdana&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Lead and facilitate the overall cross-functional project team.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;color: #333333; margin-bottom: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 9.0pt; font-family: &#39;Verdana&#39;,sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Oversee the quality of deliverables prepared by team members, including, but not limited to, fee plans, work plans, risk mitigation plans, and contracts.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
