&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Ensures continuous stakeholder (client, client’s manager, etc.) communications. addressing, resolving and anticipating project issues.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
