&lt;p&gt;The Senior Marketing Manager, Architecture provides strategic leadership across the sector, shaping enterprise marketing direction and advising senior leadership on growth strategies, market opportunities, and positioning. This role leads the development of integrated marketing approaches that align sector, industry, and corporate priorities to drive long-term business outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The role sets direction for sector marketing strategy, influences executive decision-making, and ensures alignment of messaging, capabilities, and go-to-market execution across the organization. Additionally, the Senior Marketing Manager, Architecture drives cross-sector initiatives and leads high-impact programs that support enterprise growth, pipeline development, and market differentiation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
