&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set direction for sector marketing strategy aligned to enterprise growth objectives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish enterprise-level positioning frameworks and ensure consistency across sectors and industries&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise senior leadership on market opportunities, growth strategies, and competitive positioning&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence high-priority pursuits and enterprise-level opportunities through strategic messaging and positioning guidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee development and quality of sales enablement materials across sectors to ensure strategic alignment and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the use of market intelligence, customer insights, and competitive analysis to inform enterprise strategy and investment decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure integration and alignment of campaigns and marketing programs across sectors and business units&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead cross-sector collaboration and alignment across marketing, sales, and business leadership teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence marketing investment strategy and prioritization across sectors and large-scale initiatives&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success measures and evaluate overall marketing impact on pipeline, revenue, and business outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive identification of enterprise growth opportunities and expansion strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and guide marketing team members, providing functional leadership and strategic direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-impact initiatives and transformation efforts that advance marketing effectiveness and business growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;TRAVEL REQUIREMENTS:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
