&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience leading marketing strategy, positioning, and go-to-market initiatives at a senior level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience driving cross-sector or enterprise-level initiatives preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
