&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced strategic thinking with ability to shape enterprise marketing direction&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong executive presence and ability to influence senior leaders and decision-makers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep expertise in value proposition development, positioning, and competitive strategy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial mindset with ability to link marketing to business outcomes and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced understanding of market dynamics, customer behavior, and industry trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong decision-making and prioritization skills focused on high-impact outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced analytical and data-driven decision-making capabilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to lead and influence across complex, matrixed organizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication and presentation skills for executive audiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED EDUCATION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;MBA&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
