&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support various phases of our Site/Civil projects for energy clients in Virginia, specifically in the areas of stormwater and erosion and sediment control design and permitting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stormwater and erosion and sediment control design that meet local and state regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare all permitting documents for zoning permit approval through NPDES stormwater permit approval.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform technical aspects of specified deliverables and lead a junior team member in creating deliverables consistent with scope, schedule, and budget.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Delegate appropriate tasks to junior team members and perform quality control of deliverables produced by junior team members&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage phases of projects, ensuring completion of work that meets quality assurance requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform field work and attend public meetings, as needed.&lt;/li&gt;
