&lt;p&gt;Woolpert is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Field Sales Representative&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;to join our dynamic &lt;strong&gt;Google Cloud Sales Team&lt;/strong&gt;. This position reports to the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Field Sales Manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;and is responsible for generating leads and closing Google Cloud business across North America. Our Field Sales Representatives have an innate ability to present very complex technology clearly so that non-technical prospects can understand it, conduct high-volume market research, and prospect across various information channels, with extensive follow-up and collaboration with the Google sales team and our Marketing Communications department. Woolpert is looking for an individual who can effectively articulate to prospective clients how Woolpert and Google can help them transform their information technology systems and drive change across their enterprises.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. &amp;nbsp;Applicants must already possess work authorization in the country the job is located.&lt;/p&gt;
