&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strategic relationships with the Google Cloud team, C-level executives, and key business leaders to promote Woolpert&#39;s portfolio of cloud solutions.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop Google Cloud opportunities within our existing client base as well as cold prospecting to ultimately drive revenue to Woolpert and Google.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Connect with prospects via phone, email, conferences, and events to build and maintain long-term relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Host face-to-face meetings with prospective clients to help identify needs and use cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with the Woolpert Cloud engineering team to identify use cases, support customer technical needs, and build future solutions for customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creatively work with the sales and marketing team to plan future events, campaigns, repeatable solutions, and target prospects and customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meet and exceed the annual quota of $2M.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel as required, up to 25% of the year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
