&lt;li style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;This position will primarily support projects throughout Texas and requires up to 75% travel.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
