&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Opportunities For Advancement:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Survey Instrument Operator positions may lead to advancement opportunities within the surveying department, including roles such as Survey Crew Chief, Senior Survey Crew Chief and Survey CAD Technician with additional training and experience. This job description outlines the responsibilities and qualifications for a mid-level Survey Instrument Operator, emphasizing advanced technical skills and a focus on advancement and learning opportunities while shadowing a Crew Chief.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Benefits You Will Love:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Certified as a Great Place to Work, Woolpert is one of the fastest-growing architecture, engineering, and geospatial companies in the world. With over 75 offices and countless projects around the globe, you’ll work on meaningful assignments that improve quality of life around the world. In addition to offering competitive pay, we provide employees with a robust set of unique benefits, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Freedom to Work program: Set your own schedule and location (as appropriate).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Principal program: Earn the opportunity to become an owner of the firm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Flexible paid time off/vacation: Take time off when it makes sense for you and your team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Career development: Explore a wide range of learning and growth opportunities within and across industries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Health, life, vision, and dental insurance: Cover all your medical bases.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;Paid sick time, retirement plan, fitness reimbursement, pet insurance, identity protection, technology stipend, employee assistance program, and more!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;#LI-KA1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$27.79&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$41.63 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert is an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; Woolpert is committed to the full inclusion of all individuals. We recruit, train, compensate, and promote regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law.&amp;nbsp; You may view more about EEO on our website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&quot;&gt;Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/EEO-is-the-Law-Supplement.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law Poster Supplement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants who require an accommodation throughout the application and interview process should request this in advance by contacting your Recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all agencies: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please, no phone calls or emails to any employee of Woolpert or any of our subsidiaries about this requisition. All resumes submitted by search firms/employment agencies to any employee at Woolpert via email, the internet, or in any form and/or method will be deemed the sole property of Woolpert, unless such search firms/employment agencies were engaged by Woolpert&#39;s Talent Acquisition Team for this requisition and a valid agreement is in place. In the event a candidate who was submitted outside of Woolpert&#39;s applicant process is hired, no fee or payment of any kind will be paid.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Seeking a new career challenge? Then Woolpert is seeking you! Woolpert is hiring a &lt;strong&gt;Survey Intern&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Survey and Geospatial team for the &lt;strong&gt;2027 internship program&lt;/strong&gt;. This full-time internship provides students with the opportunity to gain hands-on experience supporting field and office surveying operations while working alongside experienced survey professionals on a variety of infrastructure, transportation, aviation, utility, and geospatial projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Survey Intern, you will assist with collecting, processing, and analyzing survey data that supports engineering design, construction, mapping, asset management, and community development initiatives. You may contribute to boundary and topographic surveys, control surveys, mobile and terrestrial laser scanning, UAV support operations, GIS data collection, transportation asset inventories, and other geospatial projects that directly impact the communities where we live and work.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;This intern will be a full-time position for both field and office operations out of multiple locations with opportunities to travel.&amp;nbsp;Woolpert does not provide relocation assistance for interns.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Woolpert is unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. Applicants must already possess authorization to work in the country where this position is located.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work as an integral member of a survey field crew and project team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist licensed surveyors, survey technicians, and geospatial professionals with field data collection activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operate and learn advanced surveying technologies, including GNSS/GPS receivers, robotic total stations, digital levels, data collectors, terrestrial laser scanners, and UAV-related equipment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support topographic, boundary, utility, construction, and control surveys.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with establishing photo control points and ground control for aerial mapping and remote sensing projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collect, organize, and process survey data using industry-standard software and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development of maps, plats, reports, and survey deliverables.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Follow established safety procedures and maintain a strong commitment to workplace safety.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with project teams while developing professional problem-solving, communication, and technical skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Will Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Don&#39;t have all of these qualifications? That&#39;s okay. We know you&#39;re here to learn and grow. We encourage you to apply if you believe this opportunity is a good fit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently enrolled in an accredited college or university pursuing an Associate&#39;s or Bachelor&#39;s degree in surveying, or related field. &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with surveying principles, field procedures, and coordinate systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to GNSS/GPS equipment, total stations, laser scanning, or UAV technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with surveying and design software such as Trimble Business Center (TBC), AutoCAD Civil 3D, MicroStation/OpenRoads, ArcGIS, etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability and willingness to work outdoors in varying terrain and weather conditions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication, teamwork, and interpersonal skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivated with a willingness to learn new technologies and processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong organizational, time management, and problem-solving skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel as needed during the internship.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver&#39;s license with an acceptable driving record.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-MH1&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Onsite&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Base pay offered may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$23&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$27 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert is an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; Woolpert is committed to the full inclusion of all individuals. We recruit, train, compensate, and promote regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law.&amp;nbsp; You may view more about EEO on our website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&quot;&gt;Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/EEO-is-the-Law-Supplement.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law Poster Supplement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Applicants who require an accommodation throughout the application and interview process should request this in advance by contacting your Recruiter&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;To all agencies: &lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please, no phone calls or emails to any employee of Woolpert or any of our subsidiaries about this requisition. All resumes submitted by search firms/employment agencies to any employee at Woolpert via email, the internet, or in any form and/or method will be deemed the sole property of Woolpert, unless such search firms/employment agencies were engaged by Woolpert&#39;s Talent Acquisition Team for this requisition and a valid agreement is in place. In the event a candidate who was submitted outside of Woolpert&#39;s applicant process is hired, no fee or payment of any kind will be paid.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;At Woolpert, you’ll do work that matters.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: verdana, geneva, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;As a leading global architecture, engineering, and geospatial firm, we help clients solve complex challenges that shape communities, strengthen critical infrastructure, advance technology, and improve the world around us. Here, you’ll collaborate across disciplines, tackle meaningful projects, and build a career defined by growth, opportunity, and impact.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Woolpert is a global leader in Architecture, Engineering, and Geospatial (AEG), with a deep rooted and growing presence across Australia, building on our rich heritage as AAM. We are recognised as a Top 100 Global Design and Geospatial firm, Woolpert delivers leading-edge solutions in aerial mapping, surveying, and digital solutions for some of Asia-Pacific’s largest resources, infrastructure and environmental projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ’Woolpack’ fosters a culture of innovation, inclusion, and ownership—exemplified by our celebrated Principal Program, which offers all employees, regardless of role or employment type, the opportunity to become company owners and share in the company’s growing success. This program rewards leadership, high performance, and initiative, and is a cornerstone of Woolpert’s commitment to empowering its people and expanding diverse leadership.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Great Place to Work®!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re proud to be certified as a Great Place to Work® for the 9th time! We invest in advanced tools and professional development to empower our teams. Built on trust, respect, and shared success, our culture makes Woolpert more than a workplace it’s a community.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The role with us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Surveyor to join our growing Brisbane team. Reporting to the Brisbane Survey Manager, you’ll work across a range of civil, construction, land development and infrastructure projects. This role offers a mix of field and office work, where you’ll use your technical skills to deliver accurate and timely survey outcomes. You’ll be part of a collaborative team that values professionalism, safety and quality, with opportunities to learn more about different areas of the business as your career develops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;We are looking for&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2–3+ years’ surveying experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to 12d Model/12d Field highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;AutoCAD experience highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using Leica instruments highly regarded.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A motivated surveyor who enjoys variety in their work—both in the field and the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A detail-oriented professional with experience across civil, construction, land development and infrastructure projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who takes pride in delivering quality outcomes to clients and colleagues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A safety-conscious team member who embraces environmentally sustainable work practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An organised individual to provide administrative information such as QA records, timesheets and project documentation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Someone who’s confident contributing to tenders, quotations and client discussions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Woolpert’s Principal Program gives employees the opportunity to become&amp;nbsp;company&amp;nbsp;stakeholders&amp;nbsp;and share&amp;nbsp;in the&amp;nbsp;company’s&amp;nbsp;growth and success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employees receive&amp;nbsp;automatic Salary Continuance Insurance provided by&amp;nbsp;Woolpert.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Novated&amp;nbsp;leasing and salary sacrifice options&amp;nbsp;are available&amp;nbsp;to help&amp;nbsp;employees make the most of their&amp;nbsp;income.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted corporate health insurance through Bupa.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;As this is a full-time role, this role requires individuals with Full Working Rights in Australia.&amp;nbsp;Only shortlisted candidates will be contacted.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:6,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;With this role, the successful candidate must successfully pass pre-employment police background and drug screening. Periodic drug testing may be required per company policy.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We value diversity and inclusion at Woolpert and are committed to creating a workplace that reflects the diversity of the communities we serve. We welcome applications from First Nations peoples.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you believe you might be a good fit and would like to join our Woolpack, click on the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;APPLY NOW&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;button to submit your application. If you don’t meet all the preferred qualifications for this position, we encourage you to still apply!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-Hybrid&amp;nbsp; #LI-KS2&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Find out more about what Woolpert has to offer here:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a href=&quot;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&quot;&gt;http://woolpert.com/about-us/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Woolpert is an equal-opportunity employer.&lt;/strong&gt; Woolpert is committed to the full inclusion of all individuals. We recruit, train, compensate, and promote regardless of race, religion, color, national origin, sex, disability, age, veteran status, and other protected status as required by applicable law.&amp;nbsp; You may view more about EEO on our website: &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&quot;&gt;Equal-Employment-Opportunity-The-Law.pdf&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://woolpert.com/wp-content/uploads/2017/05/EEO-is-the-Law-Supplement.pdf&quot;&gt;EEO is the Law Poster Supplement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
