&lt;li&gt;Flexible paid time off/vacation: Take time off when it makes sense for you and your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career development: Explore a wide range of learning and growth opportunities within and across industries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Health, life, vision, and dental insurance: Cover all your medical bases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid sick time, retirement plan, fitness reimbursement, pet insurance, identity protection, technology stipend, employee assistance program, and more!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
